Third-party components bundled in the extension
-----------------------------------------------

1. Bergamot translator (WebAssembly runtime)
   Package : @browsermt/bergamot-translator 0.4.9 (npm), checked 2026-10-13
   Files   : vendor/bergamot/bergamot-translator-worker.wasm, bergamot-translator-worker.js,
             translator-worker.js — shipped UNMODIFIED from the npm package.
             vendor/bergamot/bb-worker.js is a small Brainbox wrapper (MPL-2.0) that loads
             translator-worker.js and adds one method reporting WASM heap size.
   License : Mozilla Public License 2.0 — https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
   Source  : https://github.com/browsermt/bergamot-translator

2. Firefox Translations models (downloaded on demand, never bundled)
   Source  : Mozilla model registry
             https://storage.googleapis.com/moz-fx-translations-data--303e-prod-translations-data/db/models.json
             (registry generated 2026-10-13T00:44:54Z; pinned snapshot in
             src/engines/bergamot/registry.pinned.json with the SHA-256 of every file)
   License : MPL 2.0 — per https://github.com/mozilla/translations ("The model files are
             distributed under the MPL 2.0 license."), checked 2026-10-13. The older
             mozilla/firefox-translations-models repository is no longer maintained and points
             to the same storage.

3. ELD — Efficient Language Detector (n-gram data + code, bundled in offscreen.js)
   Package : eld 2.1.0 (npm), by Nito T.M.
   License : Apache License 2.0 — https://github.com/nitotm/efficient-language-detector-js

4. Chrome built-in Translator / Language Detector APIs are part of the browser and are only
   called, not bundled.

Brainbox name and icon: from this repository (src/Translumo/Resources/Brainbox/).
